    "_id": "code-narvaro-och-incheckning-pa-bygget-en",
    "title": "Attendance and check-in on site in real time",
    "slug": "narvaro-och-incheckning-pa-bygget",
    "locale": "en",
    "excerpt": "See who's on site right now, check people in and out, and get a single attendance overview — everything you need for the staff ledger in one tool.",
    "tag": "Attendance",
    "coverImageUrl": "/landing/features/live.webp",
    "contentHtml": "<p>Knowing exactly who is on site right now is essential for both safety and planning. With attendance and check-in in ByggExp, your team members check in on site and you get a single, real-time overview — a clear record for the staff ledger and for you as the site manager. No more uncertainty about who's there.</p><h2>What are attendance and check-in?</h2><p>Attendance means that each team member marks that they are on the job site by checking in through the app. Check-in is confirmed by GPS position so the overview is accurate, and when the day is over they check out. As a site manager, you get a live picture of who is on site.</p><h2>How to do it in the web admin</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Add your team members to the project so they get access to the site.</li>\n<li>Open the attendance overview and see who's on site in real time.</li>\n<li>Use the overview as a basis for the staff ledger and follow-up.</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"web-shot\"><img src=\"/features-content/narvaro-och-incheckning-pa-bygget-web.webp\" alt=\"Staffing overview in the web admin – who is booked on site on which day\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Staffing and attendance overview in the web admin – see who is booked and on site, day by day.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>How to do it in the app</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>The team member opens the app on arrival and taps <strong>Check in</strong> – GPS confirms the job site.</li>\n<li>When the workday is over, everyone checks out in the app.</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"app-shots\"><img src=\"/features-content/narvaro-och-incheckning-pa-bygget-1.webp\" alt=\"The ByggExp app: attendance per team member – who is on site (At work) and who is not\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Attendance in the app – see in real time who is on site, per project.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li>Full real-time visibility of who is on the job site.</li><li>GPS-confirmed check-in gives reliable attendance data.</li><li>An easy record for the staff ledger with no paperwork.</li><li>Better safety — in an evacuation you know who is on site.</li></ul><h2>Tips</h2><ul><li>Make check-in a fixed routine every morning so the numbers are complete.</li><li>Review the overview before lunch to catch anyone who forgot to check in.</li><li>Have team members check out as soon as they leave so the times are accurate.</li></ul><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Is attendance different from time reporting?</h3><p>Attendance shows who is on site right now, while time reporting adds up the hours — but the check-in feeds both.</p><h3>Does it work as a basis for the staff ledger?</h3><p>Yes. The attendance overview gives you clear check-ins and check-outs per person that you can use as a record.</p><p>Want to always know who's on site? Try attendance and check-in in ByggExp and get full control in real time.</p><p class=\"eco-note\"><strong>It all connects:</strong> checking in on site feeds both <a href=\"/sv/blog/automatisk-tidrapportering-och-export\">time reporting</a> and records for the <a href=\"/sv/blog/personalliggare-bygg-app\">staff ledger</a> – the same attendance, two purposes with no duplicate work.</p>",
    "seoTitle": "Site attendance and check-in — staff ledger | ByggExp",
    "seoDescription": "Stay on top of attendance in ByggExp: on-site check-in, a real-time view of who's on the job, and records for your staff ledger.",
